why am i attracted to trying to solve  simple problems well I think one reason  is that I've always been attracted to  carnival games and you know I like  looking at these things like trying to  throw a ring around a coke bottle or  walk a tightrope breath you know bowl  over glasses with the ball and you know  just thinking about how can you do this  these kind of very simple looking things  anyone can understand what you're  supposed to do but then it's very hard  to do it and so I've always just liked  the kind of the mental challenge of  doing things like that I also like  simple problems because I think that  they reveal hidden depths in mathematics  if there's some problem that's been  around for a long time and no one's able  to solve it it means that somehow  there's a kind of completely new idea  that you need to solve it so there's  this great appeal of trying to come up  with some new idea that no one's ever  seen before  a third thing is that I'd like to do  experiments and these kind of simple  looking problems like the one on my  screen here seeing is called Langton  Zandt this is a famous unsolved problem  in maybe in complex systems or in  dynamics so I like to I like to make  computer programs and I like to run  experiments and kind of gather data and  see if I can notice patterns and these  simple problems are kind of you know  grist for the mill I can just just code  them up pretty quickly and I can do it  um another thing I like about simple  problems is I'm sort of lazy about  learning new stuff and a very impatient  person so I like to be able to just hear  the problem and just kind of jump right  in and start thinking about it I think  of these kind of simple problems is sort  of like Lords of giant mansions and and  they're kind of they're willing to sort  of let you into the ante room they'll  kind of you can kind of walk around the  lobby and they might even kind of let  you up on the first floor so they  started accessible in a certain sense  and then there's always a hope that  there's like some back door into the  mansion you can go all the way up
 

